Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:34.75,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:41.05,Note,,0,0,0,,(大学女生联谊会 东爱荷华大学)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:04.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:05.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:07.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your brother outside as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:09.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, Dean. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:13.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:15.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:18.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓我再也不猎魔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l swore I was done hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人没法完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:25.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救助他人 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:29.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我得找出杀杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:47.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 你觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:52.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 太一般了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Um-Oh, God. Too Martha Stewart?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:03.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 穿上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here. Wear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这可能不太合适吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know if this is really me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:08.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依 你不试试怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori, there's a hot chick buried somewhere in there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:10.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:23.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:27.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 美女 他绝不会想到你这么美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn, girl, he's not gonna know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我想他已经到楼下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. l think he's probably downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:33.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:35.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要做出连我没试过的事哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't do anything I wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:38.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可没什么没试过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's nothing you wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:56.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为我们要去派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought we were going to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.75,0:01:59.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们不能准时到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we can't arrive on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:01.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 我不觉得这有什么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If l didn't know any better
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:03.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你带我来这心怀不轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd think you brought me here on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:04.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:08.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让你不愉快了 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm offended. Yeah, l'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:22.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干嘛不接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wanna get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:26.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:45.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要这样 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:04.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:23.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:27.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 理查 不要 - 你在这等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No. Rich, no. - No, just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么鬼东西 - 理查 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What the hell? - Rich, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:47.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:55.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:21.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查 你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:54.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:23.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:29.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的拿铁都在这放冷了 弗朗西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your half-caf double vanilla latte is getting cold over here, Frances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:30.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}气死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:33.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有查到些什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:36.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫他们查了FBI的失踪人口档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had them check the FBI's missing-persons data bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有符合我们所描述的约翰·德斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No John Does fitting Dad's description.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:41.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我甚至去查了交通违规\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I even ran his plates for traffic violations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:44.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想说的是 我觉得爸爸不想我们找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, l'm telling you, I don't think Dad wants to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:50.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新的问题出现了 在爱荷华州. -安克尼的克里平原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a news item out of Plains Courier, Ankeny, Iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离这里有100公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's about 1 00 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:53.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体被发现在被害者自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The mutilated body was found near
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停靠在9号公路的汽车边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the victim's car parked on Nine-Mile Road."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:57.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:58.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}官方无法提供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Authorities are unable to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:01.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于杀手的外貌特征的描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}provide a realistic description of the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:03.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一的目击证人 姓名保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sole eyewitness, whose name has been withheld...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:07.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说根本没看见凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}says the attacker was invisible."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这一定很有趣 - 也许什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Could be something interesting. - Or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:12.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个证人什么都没看到 并不代表凶手是个隐型人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A witness who didn't see anything doesn't mean it's the lnvisible Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:15.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可如果凶手是的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what if it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸的话是一定会去查的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad would check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:58.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们为什么来着 - 被害人住这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- One more time, why are we here? - Victim lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:03.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车子不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:08.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是来自俄亥俄州的兄弟互助会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're your fraternity brothers. From Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:12.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚路过个镇 想找个住的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're new in town. Transfers. Looking for a place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:19.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:21.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的新室友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're your new roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:27.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我个忙 帮我把背也涂上 今天有场大狂欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then do me a favor, get my back. Big game today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:31.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个艺术家 他还干的真不赖啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the artist. The things he can do with a brush....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:38.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 莫费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, Murph..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:41.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:42.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们听说上个星期你们中有个被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We heard one of the guys around here got killed last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:47.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说是个带刀的精神病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're saying some psycho with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.31,0:07:54.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是个路过的流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe a drifter passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:55.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查 他人很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich was a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查那时和谁一起呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich was with somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:00.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not just somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:02.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然和罗依·索兰生在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori Sorenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是罗依 索兰生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's Lori Sorenson?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:07.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你背上还差一块没涂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You missed a spot. Just down there in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:13.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依是新生 她是当地人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori's a freshman. She's a local. Super hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:19.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}超级火辣 而且她是神父的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And get this, she's a reverend's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:24.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道是哪个教堂 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wouldn't happen to know which church, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:28.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的心都和失去那个年轻人 的家人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our hearts go out to the family of a young man who perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:31.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也为之祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my personal prayers of thanks go out as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:35.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我相信他是为了保护我的女儿而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I believe he died trying to protect my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:39.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间会慢慢扶平我们的创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now, as time heals all our wounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:42.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该反思这个悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we should reflect on what this tragedy means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论在教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to us as a church...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:53.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在社区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a community...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:55.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是在我们家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:09:00.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失去这个年轻人绝对是个悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The loss of a young person is particularly tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:05.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生命的失去是最可悲的经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A life unlived is the saddest of passings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:09.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以让我们祈祷为了和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So please, let us pray. For peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:14.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了指引和保护我们孩子的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for guidance and for the power to protect our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不行 那是星期天晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l can't. lt's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:22.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有我们女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just us girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.65,0:09:25.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会喝点酒 看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna do tequila shots and watch Reality Bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:27.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爸每个星期天都做晚饭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dad makes dinner every Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:28.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 罗依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:32.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你很难过 但你是有权利享受乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know this has been hard...but you are allowed to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:39.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:46.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是罗依吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我叫萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.My name is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是我哥迪恩 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This is my brother, Dean. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:53.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚转到这所大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We just transferred to the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在学校里见过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:56.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不想打扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't wanna bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:59.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们听说发生了些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We just heard about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:01.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只想说我们也很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We wanted to say how sorry we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能理解你现在的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l know what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:07.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前也亲眼目睹其他人死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw someone get hurt once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是让你毕生难忘的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's something you don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:16.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 这是 萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad, this is Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是新生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're new students.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很荣幸见到你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a pleasure to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:21.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须说那是场让人感动的布道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l must say, that was an inspiring sermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:27.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴发现年轻人 也来接受主的训诲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's so nice to find young people who are open to the Lord's message.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:33.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上我们对镇子还不熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, we're new in town, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在找…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we're looking for a church group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:41.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我罗依 警察是怎么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me, Lori, what are the police saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们也没什么线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, they don't have a lot to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:47.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他们因此归罪于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think they blame me for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:49.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:52.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我吓坏了 我猜我是看到些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was so scared, I guess I was seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.65,0:10:59.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并不意味着那就不是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That doesn't mean it wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:04.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you believe her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.55,0:11:05.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:06.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也觉得她很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I think she's hot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 伙计 看她的眼神不会有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, man, there's something in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她听到了车顶被刮擦的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And listen to this, she heard scratching on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:15.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后发现了鲜血淋淋的尸体 就挂在车上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Found the bloody body suspended upside down over the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挂着的尸体 这听着象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bloody body suspended, sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.65,0:11:19.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道 钩子人的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know. The Hook Man Legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:21.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是最有名的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:22.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会以为我们在对付钩子人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't think we're dealing with the Hook Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个传说都有源头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every urban legend has a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个它最先开始的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A place where it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:29.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那关于刮痕和刺破的轮胎呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about the phantom scratches
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:30.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那隐形杀手又什么解释呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}, tire punctures and the invisible killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:34.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这个胡克根本就不是人类 只是个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe the Hook Man isn't a man at all. What if it's some kind of spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:37.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:42.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从1851年起的拘捕记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrest records going back to 1 851 .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:46.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks. .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:52.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你度过4年快乐生活的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So this is how you spent four good years of your life, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:55.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎来到高等教育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome to higher education.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.65,0:12:02.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:07.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1862年一个传教士叫雅各布·卡恩 因为谋杀而被捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}1 862, a preacher named Jacob Carnes was arrested for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:10.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他非常恼火镇上的红灯区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was so angry over the red-light district in town...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:13.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一晚他杀了13个妓女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that one night he killed 1 3 prostitutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一些死者是在他们的床上被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Some of the deceased were found in their beds...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:18.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲜血染红了床单 另外一些尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sheets soaked with blood, others suspended upside down from trees...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:21.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被悬挂在树枝上作为对罪孽的警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a warning against sins of the flesh."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:24.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个凶器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get this. The murder weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:26.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来这个传教士在一场事故中失去了他的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The preacher lost his hand in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:28.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}换上了个银钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had it replaced with a silver hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:31.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这些是在那发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look where all this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:33.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}9号公路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nine-Mile Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:35.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那个男孩被杀的同一地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the frat boy was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:39.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得不错 威克曼博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice job, Dr. Venkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:41.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们去查查看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:57.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这是自妈妈死去后 你真正的第一次一个人住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know this is your first time really living alone since Mom died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:13:01.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是这个意思 但我担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not it. I worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:03.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里有22个女孩 绝对安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are 22 girls in there. I'm perfectly safe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是我所担心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what l worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:06.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我不知道你们会做些什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't think l know what goes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:09.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 我们不要再为此而争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do we have to have this argument again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:11.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经18岁了 我可以独立了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm over 1 8. l can live my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:13.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就意味着可以和你的室友派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which means drinking, partying with that roommate of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:16.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是成年人了 我能照顾自己 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm an adult. I can take care of myself. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:21.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依 罗依 别走 罗依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori. Lori. Come Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:03.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泰勒 你还醒着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taylor, you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:41.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:45.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它是个灵魂的话 霰弹枪可没什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it is a spirit, buckshot won't do much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:48.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 用盐块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:55.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 盐倒是对鬼魂有震慑力 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Salt being a spirit deterrent. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:59.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那杀不了它 但可以让他减速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It won't kill him, but it'll slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:01.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.45,0:15:03.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这你和爸爸想到的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and Dad think of this? l told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:07.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 大学生不一定就是天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you don't have to be a college graduate to be a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里 在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over there. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:30.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立即放下枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put the gun down now! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:31.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把手举到头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put your hands behind your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:32.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 等等 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, WaitOkay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:34.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跪下 快点 按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get down on your knees. Come on, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:36.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在趴下 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now get down on your bellies. Come on, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.35,0:15:40.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他拿着枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:40.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my God. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:05.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我救了你条小命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:07.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 好不容易把治安摆平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Talked the sheriff down to a fine. Dude, l'm Matlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:08.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:10.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他你是个傻蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Told him you were a pledge
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.45,0:17:11.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被我们耍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we were hazing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:13.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那怎么解释霰弹枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about the shotgun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说你在抓鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l said that you were hunting ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:16.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼魂会被盐块克制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that spirits were repelled by rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:19.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种恶作剧司空见惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Typical Hell Week prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:20.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就这样信了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he believed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:22.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 你的确看上去比较傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you look like a dumb-ass pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:09.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只想把她带回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just want to take her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:10.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能理解 神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand, Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但罗依现在和两起凶杀案有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Lori's now connected to two murders
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:13.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能视而不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I can't ignore that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:15.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:18.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么你就马上逮捕她 要么就让我带她回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrest her now...or let me take her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:24.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一定要让她询问时随叫随到 - 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Make sure she's available for questions. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.35,0:18:28.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 你最好跟我回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart, you're ready to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.85,0:18:30.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:03.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么那个钩子人会来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would the Hook Man come here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里离9号公路很远哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so far from Nine-Mile Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他不是总守侯在他的犯罪地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe he's not haunting the scene of his crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:09.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这和其它的事情有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe it's about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:17.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 大学女生哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, sorority girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:20.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们可以一睹春光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think we'll see a naked pillow fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:54.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对不起 - 安静点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- sorry - Hey. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:56.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我安静点 你才安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me be quiet? You be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不开灯是因为你不开心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Aren't you glad you didn't turn on the light?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.55,0:20:27.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这和传说中一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's right out of the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:29.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这肯定是钩子人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that's classic Hook Man, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:32.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也绝对是个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it's definitely a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.05,0:20:35.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没闻到过这么强烈臭氧的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.I've never smelled ozone this strong before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:40.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 看这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得这有点眼熟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does that look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:52.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the same symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:56.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该就是雅各布·卡恩的鬼魂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seems like it is the spirit of Jacob Carnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:20:59.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去找到这个家伙的坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, let's find the dude's grave
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.25,0:21:00.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他尸体上撒盐并烧掉它 把它结果掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}salt and burn the bones, and put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:03.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死刑执行后 雅各布·卡恩被埋在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"After execution, Jacob Carnes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:07.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}北边的破旧的墓园中的一个无名墓碑下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was laid to rest in Old North Cemetery......in an unmarked grave."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Super.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:13.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少我们知道他是雅各布·卡恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, so we know it's Jacob Carnes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:16.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还不清楚他的下个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we still don't know where he'll manifest next
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:18.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:21.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也在想为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll take a wild guess about why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:24.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你的朋友罗依一定和这有联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think your little friend Lori has something to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:38.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你一直瞒着我 这样的大学生活太爽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man, you've been holding out on me. This college thing is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:40.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的大学生活可不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This wasn't really my experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我猜猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:45.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}图书馆 自习 成绩优秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Library, studying, straight A's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.85,0:21:48.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太悲惨了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.15,0:21:49.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你查清楚了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, did you do your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.45,0:21:52.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我一直弄不明白 为什么钩子人老是缠着罗依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. lt was bugging me, right? How is the Hook Man tied up with Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:55.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想我查到了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So l think l came up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:03.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1932 年牧师因为谋杀而被捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"1 932, Clergyman Arrested for Murder."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.75,0:22:07.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1967年神学院的学生在嬉皮士派对上闹事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"1 967, Seminarian Held in Hippie Rampage."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:08.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有关联的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A pattern. ln both cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.65,0:22:10.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两起案件中嫌疑人都是宗教人士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the suspect was a man of religion...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.75,0:22:12.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是公然的反对道德败坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who preached against immorality and found
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:14.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后发现自己渴望杀戮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}himself wanted for killings...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说是受一股看不见的力量的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he claimed were the work of an invisible force.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.85,0:22:18.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做案的时候 看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Killings carried out, get this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:20.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使用的都是锋利的器械\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a sharp instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:22.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那和罗依有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the connection to Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:25.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宗教人士 公然的反对道德败坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man of religion......who openly preaches against immorality?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:29.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这次不是为了拯救整个城镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Except maybe this time instead of saving the whole town...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:30.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索兰生神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reverend Sorenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:32.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索兰生神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reverend Sorenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.95,0:22:34.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为是他召唤了灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think he's summoning the spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:36.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:41.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你清楚一个鬼魂怎么附着在 人身上而不是某个地点吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or you know how a poltergeist can haunt a person instead of a place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:43.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 鬼魂潜伏在 牧师压抑的情绪中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The spirit latches on to the reverend's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:45.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并依靠它而生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}repressed emotions, feeds off them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:48.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而牧师自己根本不知道这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without the reverend ever even knowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:53.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你今天晚上应该看着罗依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Either way, you should keep an eye on Lori tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:22:54.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:02.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去看看能不能找到那个无名坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna go see if l can find that unmarked grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.35,0:24:04.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.35,0:24:42.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.95,0:24:47.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次该换我去监视美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Next time...l get to watch the cute girl's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.85,0:25:03.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 传教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello, preacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.85,0:25:22.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从楼上看到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw you from upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:25.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这里干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.25,0:25:29.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在来这随便看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keeping an eye on the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:34.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我有点担心 - 担心我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l was worried. - About me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.45,0:25:36.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.85,0:25:39.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很让我感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.55,0:25:42.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和警察通过电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I already called the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.55,0:25:47.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老实说 我觉得你很关心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, seriously. l think you're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.55,0:25:52.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实你可以尽可能离我远远的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which is probably why you should run away from me as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:55.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.25,0:25:58.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好像被诅咒了或是什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like l'm cursed or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.85,0:26:01.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我身边的人一个接一个的死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}People around me keep dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.65,0:26:06.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我能理解你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.35,0:26:35.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永别了 传教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye, preacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.65,0:26:49.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有人再和我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one will talk to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.95,0:26:51.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.45,0:26:54.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}州长认为我是重要嫌疑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sheriff thinks l'm a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.45,0:26:56.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我爸爸怎么说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you know what my dad will say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.05,0:26:57.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈祷 心存信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Pray. Have faith."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:27:00.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他知道什么叫信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does he know about faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.85,0:27:05.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚听到你们在争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard you guys fighting before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.15,0:27:09.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和一个女人有染 一个接了婚的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's seeing a woman.A married woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.75,0:27:11.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l just found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.45,0:27:14.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她和她的丈夫一起来教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She comes to our church with her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.95,0:27:16.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都认识她的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l know her kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.95,0:27:21.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他却和我说什么信仰 什么道德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he talks to me about religion? About morality?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.35,0:27:24.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本不是那么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like, on one hand, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.45,0:27:26.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想做的让自己开心的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just do what you want and be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.85,0:27:29.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他却教育我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he taught me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:32.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直教导我 如果你作错了事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}raised me to believe...that if you do something wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.35,0:27:34.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会受到惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will get punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:40.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道该怎么去想这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just don't know what to think anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:10.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:12.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依 我不能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.25,0:28:16.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你心里还有其它人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That someone you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.85,0:28:21.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.45,0:28:27.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依 进来下好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori.Come inside. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.85,0:28:30.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想进来时自然会进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll come in when l'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:43.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:46.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.45,0:28:54.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.55,0:29:00.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.55,0:29:10.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. Okay, Dad, it's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.95,0:29:16.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正在聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.85,0:29:18.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后罗依的爸爸走了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then Lori's dad came out...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.45,0:29:20.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他就出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then he appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.95,0:29:24.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个子高大携带凶器的男人 带某种钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A big man. Carrying a weapon, some kind of a hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.85,0:29:26.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.45,0:29:28.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前看到过他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ever see him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.15,0:29:35.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 好像每次出事都有你的份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son, seems every time l turn around, I'm seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.35,0:29:38.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议你最好远离别管这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l suggest you try to stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.65,0:29:41.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold on there, son.Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.55,0:29:43.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 我和他一起的 我是他哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lt's all right. I'm with him.That's my brother. That's brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.35,0:29:46.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.55,0:29:50.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.75,0:29:55.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:01.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你还好吧 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.55,0:30:02.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.95,0:30:04.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钩子人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hook Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.25,0:30:05.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到他了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.15,0:30:07.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你为什么不烧掉他的尸骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn right.Why didn't you torch the bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.15,0:30:08.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What? l did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.65,0:30:10.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定是雅各布·卡恩的灵魂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sure it's the spirit of Jacob Carnes?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.72,0:30:12.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 看上去就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sure as hell looked like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.45,0:30:13.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我觉得有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.65,0:30:15.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得灵魂不是附身在神父身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't think it's latching on to the reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.85,0:30:18.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这个家伙不会让钩子人来杀他自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, yeah. The guy wouldn't send the Hook Man after himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.85,0:30:23.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他是附在罗依身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think it's latching on to Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.15,0:30:26.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天晚上她发现她父亲 和一个已婚女人有染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last night, she found out that her father is having an affair with a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.75,0:30:27.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.55,0:30:28.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她为此很不高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So she's upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.95,0:30:31.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她因为这样的道德败坏而恼怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's upset about the immorality of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.25,0:30:33.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她告诉我 她一直被教导 如果你作错了事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was raised to believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.75,0:30:35.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会受到惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you do something wrong, you get punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.35,0:30:37.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她很矛盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, so she's conflicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.55,0:30:40.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后传教士卡恩的灵魂 潜伏在她的情绪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the spirit of Carnes is latching on to her repressed emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.35,0:30:42.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为她来惩罚别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe he's doing the punishing for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:43.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.45,0:30:47.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查玩的有点过火 泰勒想把她带坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich comes on too strong, Taylor tries to make her into a party girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.35,0:30:49.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而父亲做错了事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad has an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.25,0:30:51.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记得提醒我 别去惹她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remind me not to piss this girl off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.95,0:30:55.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我把他的尸骨烧掉了 还用盐埋了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But l burned those bones. l buried them in salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.45,0:30:57.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么还不能阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't that stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.05,0:31:00.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定是遗漏了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must have missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.05,0:31:03.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把棺材里的东西都烧掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I burned everything in that coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.35,0:31:05.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找到了那钩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you get the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.35,0:31:08.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.95,0:31:11.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是那凶器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the murder weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.05,0:31:13.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某种意义上它就是他的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in a way, it was part of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:19.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以对于他来讲 钩子是他力量的源泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So like the bones, the hook is a source of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.45,0:31:21.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以当我们找到了钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So if we find the hook...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.55,0:31:23.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就能阻止钩子人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we stop the Hook Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.05,0:31:33.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查到了些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's something, l think.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.95,0:31:35.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱荷华州监狱的日志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Logbook, lowa State Penitentiary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.65,0:31:39.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雅各布·卡恩被关押在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Carnes, Jacob. Personal effects...disposition thereof."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.05,0:31:40.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有提到那钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does it mention the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.05,0:31:44.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在行刑前所有的物品都被收押在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, maybe. "Upon execution, all earthly items shall be remanded...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.15,0:31:45.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}监狱犯的祈祷室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the Prisoner's House of Worship
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.75,0:31:47.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣巴拿巴教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}St. Barnabus Church."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.45,0:31:49.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不就是罗依的爸爸布道的地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lsn't that where Lori's father preaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.65,0:31:50.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.65,0:31:53.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依也是住那儿的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where Lori lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.35,0:31:55.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是为什么钩子人 在两百年后还缠上了神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe that's why he's been haunting reverends
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:57.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和神父的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and reverends' daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.45,0:31:59.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果那钩子在教堂或是罗依的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the hook were there, don't you think
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.25,0:32:00.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那为什么没人能看到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}someone might have seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.95,0:32:04.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指 那染满血迹银把手的钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, a blood-stained, silver-handled hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.65,0:32:07.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看教堂的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check the church records.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.55,0:32:11.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1862 年收到圣巴拿巴教堂的捐赠品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"St. Barnabus, donations, 1 862.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.85,0:32:15.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个银把手的钩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ilver-handled hook from state penitentiary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.35,0:32:18.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重铸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reforged."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.55,0:32:19.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当州监狱改造后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They melted it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.25,0:32:22.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们溶化了它做成了其他东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Made it into something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:37.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 我们不能错过任何机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}alright We can't take any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.85,0:32:39.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到任何银的物品都投入火中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything silver goes in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.55,0:32:41.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.65,0:32:42.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依还在医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori's still at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.85,0:32:44.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得破门而入了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll have to break in
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.05,0:32:45.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你先选地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}.All right. Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.85,0:32:47.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我选她家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'll take the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.25,0:32:48.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.65,0:32:52.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.15,0:32:55.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别去偷看别人的内衣抽屉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay out of her underwear drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.75,0:33:14.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把所有的看上去是银的都拿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l got everything that even looked silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.15,0:33:15.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保险一点比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lBetter safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.35,0:33:31.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.25,0:34:06.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.85,0:34:09.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这里干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.15,0:34:10.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.15,0:34:15.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道这发生的一切 这是为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been trying to understand what's been happening. Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.35,0:34:18.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我知道了 我在祈祷被宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I know, so l'm praying for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.15,0:34:20.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宽恕什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgiveness for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.85,0:34:22.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.35,0:34:25.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我导致了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm to blame for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.25,0:34:28.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我读了圣经里的复仇天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've read in the Bible about avenging angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.05,0:34:29.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trust me. This guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.65,0:34:32.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's no angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.95,0:34:35.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是那么恼怒我的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was so angry at my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.85,0:34:38.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至有点想他被惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Part of me wanted him punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.75,0:34:41.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他就出现了 惩罚了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then he came and he punished him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.35,0:34:43.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lt's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:44.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.85,0:34:47.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道为什么 但这是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know how, but it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:50.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我杀了 理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I killed Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.25,0:34:51.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泰勒也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taylor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.55,0:34:53.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我几乎杀了我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I nearly killed my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.55,0:34:55.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.45,0:34:58.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.65,0:35:00.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不应该受到惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They didn't deserve to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.65,0:35:02.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该受到惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.95,0:35:18.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.05,0:35:28.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.20,0:35:30.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.15,0:35:53.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.25,0:36:03.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.65,0:36:19.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 蹲下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam! Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.15,0:36:26.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为我们把所有的银器都烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l thought we got all the silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.05,0:36:28.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他还在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why is he still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.35,0:36:30.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们还差了点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, maybe we missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.55,0:36:34.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依 你从那里得到这个项链的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lori, where did you get that chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.75,0:36:37.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我父亲给我的 - 他从哪里得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My father gave it to me. - Where'd your dad get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.05,0:36:39.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是教堂的传下来的 他给了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He said it was a church heirloom.He gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.65,0:36:42.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是银的吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- ls it silver? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.15,0:36:59.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.95,0:38:14.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也看到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you saw him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.55,0:38:15.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个带钩子的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man with the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.45,0:38:16.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我告诉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I told you. We all saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.35,0:38:17.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都看到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We fought him
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.55,0:38:19.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们和他搏斗 然后他就跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}off and then he ran. And that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.55,0:38:20.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是事情全部吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.05,0:38:22.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that's all.
